                                                "sense_id": "293bfee9-87a9-3e67-ae48-d6eedf624956",
                                                "text": "A wire \"Wobbler\" holds a card for counter display"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1dd5d829-e904-471e-96f7-d886a7c87402",
                                                "sense_id": "293bfee9-87a9-3e67-ae48-d6eedf624956",
                                                "text": "Yesterday saw the launch of the initiative, which will use advertising “shelf wobblers” that usually publicise special offers to encourage Bristol shoppers to bring back their plastic bottles for recycling."
